      "description": "Automated VMware vCenter operations and security enforcement with Ansible playbooks; implemented logging and monitoring for encrypted VMs via the vRealize Log Insight API. Migrated Windows host configuration management from Puppet to native GPO, maintaining server hardening. Replaced SCOM with Datadog for Windows hosts; automated Datadog agent setup (PowerShell + Ansible) and tag enforcement via GPO. Automated Linux admin processes; integrated Linux access provisioning with ServiceNow, OpenLDAP and Django APIs; managed Puppet codebase. Provisioned AWS FSx NetApp with Terraform and GitHub Actions; built SSM Documents for EC2 post-provisioning standards; designed CI/CD pipelines. ITIL and Agile."
