      "description": "Full-stack maintenance of in-house platform: merchant store website (Laravel), merchant admin panel (VueJS), app integrations (Laravel), API (Ruby on Rails), cron jobs. Improved the API with integration testing, third-party marketing integrations and serverless computing. Built reusable libraries; documented changes (Notion, Postman); code reviews and guiding junior developers; Scrum; CI/CD (GitHub + Buddy); TDD. Also Redis, Docker, Linux, AWS Lambda, SQS, push notifications, JIRA."
